ráli."},{"d":"2017-03-20","l":"jaro 2017","v":"HRAB3","h":false,"s":"1:2","hf":"0:0","r":"W","ref":"","w":"Utkání průměrné úrovně, ve kterém dokázal hostující tým zvítězit."},{"d":"2015-11-09","l":"podzim 2015","v":"HRAB3","h":false,"s":"3:3","hf":"0:2","r":"D","ref":"Norman David, Michal Kubeš","w":"Mírně nervózní utkání vyrovnaného průběhu skončilo spravedlivou remízou."},{"d":"2014-09-08","l":"podzim 2014","v":"HRAB2","h":true,"s":"3:3","hf":"1:2","r":"D","ref":"","w":"Zápas byl poměrně vyrovnaný. Šancí bylo na obou stranách stejně. Zápas skončil spravedlivým výsledkem."},{"d":"2013-10-07","l":"podzim 2013","v":"HRAB1","h":false,"s":"3:1","hf":"2:0","r":"L","ref":"Lukáš Ležák, Jindřich Landa","w":"Poklidný, férový zápas s lehkou převahou domácích."},{"d":"2012-12-03","l":"podzim 2012","v":"MIKU4","h":true,"s":"3:0","hf":"1:0","r":"W","ref":"Husák","w":"Senioři dokázali proměnit své šance a proto zaslouženě zvítězili."},{"d":"2011-04-18","l":"jaro 2011","v":"HRAB1","h":true,"s":"2:1","hf":"1:0","r":"W","ref":"Pavel Klíma, Václav Kala","w":"Rozhodčí se k zápasu nevyjádřil."}]},"cr":[["j2007","6-f",3,12,"11","6","2","3","26:20","14"],["p2007","6-f",5,12,"11","6","0","5","25:25","12"],["j2008","6-g",11,12,"11","1","2","8","16:42","4"],["p2008","7-f",2,12,"11","7","2","2","24:13","16"],["j2009","6-f",12,12,"11","0","3","8","11:44","3"],["p2009","7-f",3,12,"11","7","3","1","24:11","17"],["j2010","6-g",12,12,"11","0","5","6","9:20","5"],["p2010","7-f",12,12,"11","1","0","10","9:59","2"],["j2011","8-a",6,12,"11","4","2","5","22:24","10"],["p2011","8-a",2,12,"11","7","4","0","29:14","18"],["j2012","7-b",6,12,"11","5","3","3","28:17","12"],["p2012","7-a",2,12,"11","5","3","3","30:20","13"],["j2013","6-a",12,12,"11","2","1","8","19:40","5"],["p2013","7-a",10,12,"11","4","0","7","28:47","8"],["j2014","8-b",5,12,"11","6","2","3","29:15","14"],["p2014","8-a",5,12,"11","5","2","4","26:20","12"],["j2015","8-a",6,12,"11","4","3","4","18:21","11"],["p2015","8-b",6,12,"11","5","1",